<title>THAILAND: Thai Danu, Finance One shares still suspended.</title>
<headline>Thai Danu, Finance One shares still suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand said on Monday trading in Thai Danu Bank Plc and Finance One Plc will remain suspended while it awaits information on their merger plan.</p>
<p>The SET has suspended trading in both shares since March 3 when news of the merger plan first broke.</p>
<p>Thai Danu and Finance on Friday signed a memorandum of understanding agreeing to merge, the first step towards the biggest merger ever in the company's financial sector.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
